    "body": "Hello Team,\r\nIn Keyple V1, we used to catch exceptions like **_CalypsoSamAccessForbiddenException_** to report errors with a fine granularity.\r\nIn the latest versions of this package, these exception are not thrown directly but rather encapsulated in a generic one. The original exception is still present in a **_cause_** but the exception have become package private.\r\nIs there any reason for this visibility change? I understand why it's final but I don't see why it's package private.\r\nIs there any other way to get this information?\r\nThan you for your help.",
